  "worked_solution": "The area of the surface area of the sphere is given by  \n\n$$\nA=A(r)=4\\pi {r}^{2}\n$$\n\nwhere $r$ is the radius of the sphere.\n\nTherefore, the rate of change of $A(r)$ with respect to its radius $r$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{\u2032}(r) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}r}(4\\pi {r}^{2}) \\\\  & =4\\pi (2r) \\\\  & =8\\pi r.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
